  "audio_unit": {
    "type": "aumf",
    "subtype": "TKI2",
    "manufacturer": "NDSP",
    "note": "`scripts/audit_manifest.py --pack toneking` parses the Audio Unit state through the preset format and maps 94 of 255 numeric state keys to controls by experiment. Those mappings cover 94 of the 96 published controls; the other two are host-only Preset Previous/Next controls. A key not reached by the one-value nudge remains unverified: no movement does not by itself prove that no control exists."
  },
  "draft": true,
  "drafted_from": "Default.xml",
  "description": "DRAFT pack for Tone King Imperial MKII, in the second Neural DSP preset encoding: 8-byte binary doubles inside PARAM records. Reading, editing and writing all work. 94 of 255 numeric state keys have been VERIFIED against the running plugin by writing each key into the plugin's own state and reading back which control moved (scripts/probe_state.py); for those, the kind and the plugin's own control name are facts, and a numeric range is declared where the plugin published one. The mappings cover every published control except the host-only Preset Previous/Next controls. The 161 numeric keys not reached by the one-value experiment remain unverified; most carry `needs_review` when their kind was guessed.",
